TimeChangerAide_Text_1::
  .string "{COLOR BLUE}Hey {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}!\p"
  .string "{COLOR BLUE}I've been working on a prototype\n"
  .string "for a time changer device.\p"
  .string "Surely, you could find this useful.\p"
  .string "I could teach it to you if\n"
  .string "you can handle some trivia.\p"
  .string "You want to give it a go?$"


