TimeChangerAide_Text_6::
  .string "To use the Time Changer, press {L_BUTTON}\n"
  .string "to bring up your skills.\p"
  .string "Use it, and choose a time of\n"
  .string "day to change to.\p"
  .string "Note that you'll be stuck in\n"
  .string "that time of day until you\l"
  .string "click the Reset option or change\l"
  .string "to another time of day.$"


PalletTown_Text_OakFight1::
  .string "Well, {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}{COLOR BLUE}, I knew you had\n"
  .string "a lot in you, but I never would\l"
  .string "have guessed you'd become Champ!\p"
  .string "Not this quick!\p"
  .string "Well, I'm nowhere as strong as I was\n"
  .string "in my prime, but I could cause you\l"
  .string "some trouble.\p"
  .string "I've got a new item I've been\n"
  .string "working on that I'd like to test.\p"
  .string "How about it?$"


PalletTown_Text_OakFight2::
  .string "Alright, let's see if these old\n"
  .string "bones still got it!$"


PalletTown_Text_OakScared::
  .string "Scared of this old timer?\n"
  .string "Wahahaha!$"


PalletTown_Text_OakWarmup::
  .string "Hm, that was just a warm up.$"


PalletTown_Text_OakStillGot::
  .string "Huh, you thought we were done?\n"
  .string "This old man still has more left\l"
  .string "in him!$"


PalletTown_Text_LossForReal::
  .string "Okay, okay.\n"
  .string "You got me.$"


PalletTown_Text_OakFight3::
  .string "Heh, sorry to cheat like that,\n"
  .string "{COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}.\p"
  .string "{COLOR BLUE}I knew I had to throw everything\n"
  .string "and the kitchen sink at you to\l"
  .string "stand a chance.\p"
  .string "Here, have the item I've been\n"
  .string "working on.\p"
  .string "The Eevium Z normally only works\n"
  .string "on Eevee, but I've polished it to\l"
  .string "work on its evolutions as well.\p"
  .string "Although on Eevee, it gives +2 to all\n"
  .string "stats, it only gives +2 to\l"
  .string "offensive stats on the Eeveelutions.\p"
  .string "You need Last Resort to proc this.\p"
  .string "Still not a bad item at all!\p"
  .string "All yours!$"


PalletTown_Text_OakFight4::
  .string "Well, get back at it, {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}.\p"
  .string "{COLOR BLUE}I'm sure {COLOR GREEN}{RIVAL}{COLOR BLUE} is still\n"
  .string "training to become stronger, so\l"
  .string "don't fall behind.$"


PalletTown_Text_AideStop1::
  .string "{COLOR BLUE}Hey {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}!\p"
  .string "Starting on your journey eh?\n"
  .string "Must be exciting!\p"
  .string "Anyway, the professor told me not to\n"
  .string "let any newbies through here.\p"
  .string "Sorry about that!$"


